                                "sense_id": "c639d852-6ab8-3270-9471-b012bbebd377",
                                "text": "\"The he won't depart,\" I replied, and approached still nearer. Rough and narrow ledges formed by nature gave access to the upper caves. A man might scale them if unhampered and unhindered, but to clamber upward in the face of a belligerent tribe of half-men and with a girl to assist was beyond my capability."
                            },
